WeaningTest
├── weanStage
│   ├── given the first week
│   │   └── it starts by changing nothing
│   ├── given later weeks
│   │   └── it moves through the stages on schedule
│   ├── given weaning was never started
│   │   └── it does nothing
│   └── given a clock that went backwards
│       └── it is not fooled
├── daysToNextStage
│   ├── given a stage still ahead
│   │   └── it says how long until the next step
│   ├── given the last stage is reached
│   │   └── it stops counting
│   ├── given weaning was never started
│   │   └── it says nothing
│   └── given the start is still ahead
│       └── it counts down to the day weaning begins
└── describeStage
    ├── it describes every stage
    └── it gives each stage its own wording
